{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2021-05-17 13:46:00', 'title': "DUKE ENERGY RESPONDS TO ELLIOTT MANAGEMENT'S LETTER", 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C., MAY 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BELOW IS DUKE ENERGY'S (NYSE: DUK) STATEMENT IN RESPONSE TO ELLIOTT MANAGEMENT'S ANNOUNCEMENT TODAY: TODAY'S ANNOUNCEMENT BY ELLIOTT IS THE LATEST IN A SERIES OF PROPOSALS THAT THE HEDGE FUND HAS OFFERED TO DUKE ENERGY SINCE JULY 2020."}{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2021-05-17 13:25:00', 'title': "NEW PLAZA IN UPTOWN CHARLOTTE TO BECOME DUKE ENERGY'S CORPORATE HEADQUARTERS", 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C., MAY 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUKE ENERGY TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT DUKE ENERGY PLAZA, THE 40-FLOOR OFFICE TOWER CURRENTLY UNDER CONSTRUCTION IN UPTOWN CHARLOTTE, WILL BECOME THE COMPANY'S NEW CORPORATE HEADQUARTERS."}